  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Rural Women&apos;s Access to Markets and Trade</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to women&#x2019;s economic empowerment and improve livelihoods through enhanced agricultural production andaccess to markets. The underlying rationale is to equip women with relevant knowledge and skills as well as enhance their leadership and organizational capabilities to enable them become drivers of their own social and economic transformation.</narrative>
  </description>
